# Pin line endings repo-side: commit LF, check out LF — overrides each machine's
# core.autocrlf, so no conversion round-trip and no "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# warnings. Windows-only script types stay CRLF; later rules win over the wildcard.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
